{"3689060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Desktop Forest", "steam_appid": 3689060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/a8520ace484e702f850601c2933df23a.poster.avif?t=1771207417\" width=1170 height=702 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/a8520ace484e702f850601c2933df23a.webm?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/a8520ace484e702f850601c2933df23a.mp4?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a desktop forest that keeps you company while you work, study, or play. Drop the window anywhere, resize to fit, and touch some grass. Simple, soothing, and light on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>What is it?</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Chill trees :</strong> Grow an endless combination of nice crunchy pixel forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Regrow Anytime :</strong> Resprout the grove whenever you're bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Recolor :</strong> Shift from spring greens to flaming fall reds or wild neon pixels with a click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>2 Art styles :</strong> Nostalgic lofi psx pixels or hand drawn noir!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Pick the perfect View :</strong> Close up, wide panoramas, find the shot that feels right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Audio :</strong> Hours of calm music  with birds, wind, and gentle nature sounds. Mute or mix.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Launch Desktop Forest and let nature keep you company all day!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/ea534c98599c47579a145e080e78853c.poster.avif?t=1771207417\" width=1170 height=702 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/ea534c98599c47579a145e080e78853c.webm?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/ea534c98599c47579a145e080e78853c.mp4?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/a8520ace484e702f850601c2933df23a.poster.avif?t=1771207417\" width=1170 height=702 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/a8520ace484e702f850601c2933df23a.webm?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/a8520ace484e702f850601c2933df23a.mp4?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a desktop forest that keeps you company while you work, study, or play. Drop the window anywhere, resize to fit, and touch some grass. Simple, soothing, and light on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>What is it?</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Chill trees :</strong> Grow an endless combination of nice crunchy pixel forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Regrow Anytime :</strong> Resprout the grove whenever you're bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Recolor :</strong> Shift from spring greens to flaming fall reds or wild neon pixels with a click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>2 Art styles :</strong> Nostalgic lofi psx pixels or hand drawn noir!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Pick the perfect View :</strong> Close up, wide panoramas, find the shot that feels right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Audio :</strong> Hours of calm music  with birds, wind, and gentle nature sounds. Mute or mix.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Launch Desktop Forest and let nature keep you company all day!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/ea534c98599c47579a145e080e78853c.poster.avif?t=1771207417\" width=1170 height=702 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/ea534c98599c47579a145e080e78853c.webm?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/ea534c98599c47579a145e080e78853c.mp4?t=1771207417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Desktop Forest turns any corner of your screen into a tiny Forest! Regrow, recolor, and relax to hours of calm music and gentle nature sounds.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Afrikaans, Albanian, Amharic, Armen